# Marketing Funnel & Conversion Performance Analysis

## Project Overview
This project focuses on analyzing marketing funnel performance and customer conversion trends using Tableau Public.

The objective of this analysis is to understand how users move through the marketing funnel and identify opportunities to improve lead conversion and campaign performance.

The dashboard helps analyze:
- Conversion performance
- Campaign effectiveness
- Contact channel efficiency
- Monthly funnel trends
- Customer acquisition insights

---

## Objectives
- Analyze visitor-to-customer conversion trends
- Compare campaign performance
- Identify high-performing contact channels
- Understand monthly conversion behavior
- Generate actionable recommendations to improve conversions

---

##  Tools Used
- Tableau Public
- CSV Dataset
- Data Visualization & Analytics

---

## Dashboard Features
- Conversion Overview
- Campaign Performance Analysis
- Contact Conversion Analysis
- Monthly Funnel Performance
- Interactive Dashboard Filters

---

##  Key Insights
- Certain campaigns generated significantly higher conversions
- Contact methods impacted customer conversion performance
- Some months showed stronger customer acquisition trends
- Funnel drop-offs highlighted optimization opportunities

---

##  Business Recommendations
- Focus marketing budget on high-performing campaigns
- Improve low-converting funnel stages
- Prioritize effective contact channels
- Optimize lead nurturing and follow-up strategies

---

